  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed an exception thrown when opening a project whose Modules or PageFrames folder does not exist (e.g. an empty folder dropped when the project is shared via git). The missing folders are now recreated before the file watcher starts.\n- Search state no longer carries over between projects: the Solution Explorer and Toolbox filter boxes, the References pane results, and the SQL result pane are cleared when a project is opened or closed.\n- Fixed toast notifications (deploy results and similar) being placed off-screen while the designer window was maximized. The toast is now anchored to the window's actual on-screen area and follows it when the window is moved, resized, or maximized.\n- Script editor: the \"in\" of a foreach statement is now highlighted as a keyword.\n- Script editor: interpolated strings are highlighted like an editor would expect - the literal part keeps the string color while the interpolation holes are highlighted as code (keywords and type names inside them are colored). Escaped braces (\"{{\" / \"}}\") are not treated as holes.",
  "repository": {
